(Penny:)Come on, smile.

5
00:00:12,113 --> 00:00:13,883
(Penny:)This is gonna be
my Christmas card.

6
00:00:19,087 --> 00:00:22,417
(in nasal voice):
You know this is
all your fault.

7
00:00:22,423 --> 00:00:25,823
(in nasal voice):
How is it my fault?

8
00:00:25,827 --> 00:00:27,797
(Sheldon:)I told you not to
get the surgery.

9
00:00:27,795 --> 00:00:31,335
(Leonard:)Okay, first of all,
the surgery was a success,

10
00:00:31,332 --> 00:00:33,632
