I didn't even want you there.

11
00:00:33,634 --> 00:00:37,434
(Sheldon:)Wow. I don't know
which hurts worse--

12
00:00:37,438 --> 00:00:39,508
(Sheldon:)my nose or my heart.

13
00:00:40,608 --> 00:00:42,108
(Sheldon:)Well, I'm done
speaking to you.

14
00:00:42,110 --> 00:00:43,280
AMY:
Don't be like that.

15
00:00:43,277 --> 00:00:45,277
(Amy:)You two need to
talk this out.

16
00:00:45,279 --> 00:00:47,409
(Penny:)Yeah, 'cause
you sound really funny.

17
00:00:49,951 --> 00:00:52,521
(Leonard:)Sheldon, I'm sorry I didn't
tell you about the surgery,

18
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:54,650
(Leonard:)but you were worried
about nothing.

19
00:00:54,655 --> 00:00:56,855
(Sheldon:)Oh, you're hardly
out of the woods, no.

20
00:00:56,858 --> 00:00:59,688
(Sheldon:)You still run the risk of
infection, a blood clot,

21
